<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mesa Air lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mesa Air lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said Thursday it lowered its rating on Mesa Air Group Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst William Wrightson said he had recommended the shares because they were trading below book value, but this recommendation was no longer justified given the company's continued earnings disappointments.</p>
<p>-- &quot;There is a higher earnings risk going forward as well because of the repossession of some Mesa routes by United Airlines,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Mesa was down 1/32 at 5-1/32.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
